# Fast Testing Directives

When writing features, refactoring, or debugging:
- **Do not run full test suites during iteration.**
- Use `./scripts/test.sh --only <SuiteName>` or `make test-only SUITE=<SuiteName>` to run only the relevant test class (takes 1-2s).
- Use `./scripts/test.sh --fast` or `make test-fast` for pre-completion checks (skips 30MB GeoJSON load and hash validation).
- Avoid running `PerformanceGateTests` unless explicitly benchmarking dataset loading.
